msgstr "Semua koneksi antara komputer Anda dan server web dienkripsi."

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"The data entered in the form you fill out are transferred in encrypted form "
"to an internal server."
msgstr ""
"Data yang dimasukkan dalam formulir yang Anda isi ditransfer dalam bentuk "
"terenkripsi ke server internal."

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"We take all necessary technical and organizational security measures to "
"protect your personal data from loss and abuse."
msgstr ""
"Kami mengambil semua langkah keamanan teknis dan organisasi yang diperlukan "
"untuk melindungi data pribadi Anda dari kehilangan dan penyalahgunaan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"We will then send you an e-mail with a confirmation link to verify your "
"e-mail address."
msgstr ""
"Kami kemudian akan mengirimi Anda email dengan tautan konfirmasi untuk "
"memverifikasi alamat email Anda."

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Your data are stored in a secure operating environment that is not "
"accessible to the public."
msgstr ""
"Data Anda disimpan dalam lingkungan operasi yang aman dan tidak dapat "
"diakses oleh publik."

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/lucid_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/voluntary_with_no_compensation_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-title"
msgid "We need your consent to proceed"
msgstr "Kami membutuhkan persetujuan Anda untuk melanjutkan"

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Keamanan"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgid "per hour"
msgstr "per jam"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid ""
"If you satisfactorily complete the study, we compensate you for your "
"participation:"
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda menyelesaikan penelitian ini dengan memuaskan, kami akan "
"memberikan kompensasi atas partisipasi Anda:"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid "We appreciate your contribution to science!"
msgstr "Kami menghargai kontribusi Anda terhadap ilmu pengetahuan!"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid ""
"You may also receive an additional payment based on your performance in the "
"task."
msgstr ""
"Anda juga dapat menerima pembayaran tambahan berdasarkan kinerja Anda dalam "
"tugas tersebut."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"The purpose of this project is to study how people from different places in "
"the world experience sounds (e.g., speech, music) and images (e.g., faces, "
"color)."
msgstr ""
"Tujuan dari proyek ini adalah untuk mempelajari bagaimana orang-orang dari "
"berbagai tempat di dunia merasakan suara (misalnya, ucapan, musik) dan "
"gambar (misalnya, wajah, warna)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid "Confidentiality"
msgstr "Kerahasiaan"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/voluntary_with_no_compensation_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid "Compensation"
msgstr "Kompensasi"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-benefits"
msgid ""
"Although it may not directly benefit you, this study may benefit society by "
"helping us understanding how humans derive information from sound and "
"vision, and potentially to help engineer machines that can replicate our "
"abilities (e.g. in sound recognition and computer vision) and to help "
"improve perceptual abilities in people whose hearing or sight is impaired."
msgstr ""
"Meskipun mungkin tidak secara langsung bermanfaat bagi Anda, penelitian ini "
"dapat bermanfaat bagi masyarakat dengan membantu kita memahami bagaimana "
"manusia memperoleh informasi dari suara dan penglihatan, dan berpotensi "
"membantu merekayasa mesin yang dapat meniru kemampuan kita (misalnya dalam "
"pengenalan suara dan visi komputer) serta membantu meningkatkan kemampuan "
"persepsi pada orang yang mengalami gangguan pendengaran atau penglihatan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-benefits"
msgid "Benefits"
msgstr "Manfaat"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"For the purpose of helping scientific progress and replication, sometimes we"
" may share the data with research collaborators."
msgstr ""
"Untuk tujuan membantu kemajuan ilmiah dan replikasi, terkadang kami dapat "
"membagikan data dengan kolaborator penelitian."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"In these cases, we will only share fully anonymized data, such as "
"demographic, aggregated, or extracted data without any personal identifiers."
msgstr ""
"Dalam kasus ini, kami hanya akan membagikan data yang sepenuhnya "
"dianonimkan, seperti data demografis, agregat, atau data yang diekstraksi "
"tanpa pengidentifikasi pribadi."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid "Research collaborations"
msgstr "Kolaborasi penelitian"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"All of the information we obtain during the research will be kept "
"confidential."
msgstr ""
"Semua informasi yang kami peroleh selama penelitian akan dijaga "
"kerahasiaannya."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Although researchers will not use your alpha numeric code to derive your "
"real identity, this record could be linked in some cases to your public "
"profile page if a data breach takes place."
msgstr ""
"Meskipun para peneliti tidak akan menggunakan kode alfa numerik Anda untuk "
"mendapatkan identitas asli Anda, catatan ini dapat ditautkan dalam beberapa "
"kasus ke halaman profil publik Anda jika terjadi pelanggaran data."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid "Consenting to these additional requirements is also fully voluntary."
msgstr ""
"Menyetujui persyaratan tambahan ini juga sepenuhnya bersifat sukarela."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"If an experiment is collecting data that cannot be fully anonymized, we will"
" inform you and also ask for additional consent."
msgstr ""
"Jika eksperimen mengumpulkan data yang tidak dapat dianonimkan sepenuhnya, "
"kami akan memberi tahu Anda dan juga meminta persetujuan tambahan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"No personal identifiers (e.g. your name or contact data) will be collected "
"or used at any stage of the experiment."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada pengidentifikasi pribadi (misalnya nama atau data kontak Anda) "
"yang akan dikumpulkan atau digunakan pada setiap tahap eksperimen."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"These include experiments where we make audio-visual recordings or where we "
"need your contact details to contact you in the future to take another "
"experiment."
msgstr ""
"Ini termasuk eksperimen di mana kami membuat rekaman audio-visual atau di "
"mana kami memerlukan detail kontak Anda untuk menghubungi Anda di masa depan"
" untuk melakukan eksperimen lain."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"This code will not be used to derive your real identity, will not be shared "
"with anyone outside of the research team and will be deleted after use."
msgstr ""
"Kode ini tidak akan digunakan untuk mendapatkan identitas asli Anda, tidak "
"akan dibagikan kepada siapa pun di luar tim peneliti dan akan dihapus "
"setelah digunakan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid "Thus, the experimental data is anonymous."
msgstr "Dengan demikian, data eksperimen bersifat anonim."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Thus, you may wish to restrict what information you choose to share "
"publicly."
msgstr ""
"Dengan demikian, Anda mungkin ingin membatasi informasi apa yang Anda pilih "
"untuk dibagikan secara publik."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"We may collect some demographic data (e.g. age, gender, country of "
"residence) as well as information about your learning and exposure history "
"(e.g. musical experience playing an instrument, years of formal education, "
"languages spoken)."
msgstr ""
"Kami dapat mengumpulkan beberapa data demografis (misalnya usia, jenis "
"kelamin, negara tempat tinggal) serta informasi tentang riwayat pembelajaran"
" dan paparan Anda (misalnya pengalaman bermusik dengan alat musik, lama "
"pendidikan formal, bahasa yang digunakan)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"We will only save your anonymized alpha numeric code in our system, in order"
" to distinguish participants who have already taken part in this or other "
"experiments."
msgstr ""
"Kami hanya akan menyimpan kode alfanumerik anonim Anda dalam sistem kami, "
"untuk membedakan peserta yang telah mengambil bagian dalam eksperimen ini "
"atau eksperimen lainnya."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"Finally, in some experiments you may be asked to make a voice or video "
"recording, for example, you may be asked to record your finger-tapping in "
"response to a sound or video, or to record yourself speaking or singing."
msgstr ""
"Terakhir, dalam beberapa eksperimen, Anda mungkin diminta untuk membuat "
"rekaman suara atau video, misalnya, Anda mungkin diminta untuk merekam "
"ketukan jari Anda dalam merespons suara atau video, atau merekam diri Anda "
"sendiri yang sedang berbicara atau bernyanyi."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"For example, you may be asked to judge how pleasant a particular sound or an"
" image is, or to categorize sounds or images (e.g., if a sound or an image "
"is that of a car or a cow), or to judge other basic features of sounds or "
"images (e.g., how frequently do you encounter this type of sound or image? "
"how aesthetically pleasing you consider a particular sound or image?)."
msgstr ""
"Sebagai contoh, Anda mungkin diminta untuk menilai seberapa menyenangkan "
"suara atau gambar tertentu, atau untuk mengkategorikan suara atau gambar "
"(misalnya, apakah suara atau gambar tersebut adalah suara mobil atau sapi), "
"atau untuk menilai ciri-ciri dasar lain dari suara atau gambar (misalnya, "
"seberapa sering Anda menemukan jenis suara atau gambar tersebut, seberapa "
"menyenangkan secara estetika yang Anda anggap sebagai suara atau gambar "
"tertentu?)"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"If the experiment will contain these elements we will ask for an additional "
"consent."
msgstr ""
"Jika eksperimen akan mengandung elemen-elemen ini, kami akan meminta "
"persetujuan tambahan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"If you volunteer to participate in this study, you will be asked to perform "
"simple tasks using your keyboard or mouse while listening to sounds, or "
"while observing images or videos."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda secara sukarela berpartisipasi dalam penelitian ini, Anda akan "
"diminta untuk melakukan tugas-tugas sederhana menggunakan keyboard atau "
"mouse sambil mendengarkan suara, atau sambil mengamati gambar atau video."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"In some experiments, we may use mild deception, i.e., we may not explain the"
" full truth regarding an experimental task (for example we will not tell you"
" that an image was generated by an artificial computer system and not a "
"human)."
msgstr ""
"Dalam beberapa eksperimen, kami mungkin menggunakan penipuan ringan, yaitu, "
"kami mungkin tidak menjelaskan kebenaran penuh terkait tugas eksperimen "
"(misalnya kami tidak akan memberi tahu Anda bahwa sebuah gambar dihasilkan "
"oleh sistem komputer buatan dan bukan manusia)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"Mild deception will only be used in some experiments where we need to "
"prevent biasing the participants before taking the experiment."
msgstr ""
"Penipuan ringan hanya akan digunakan pada beberapa eksperimen di mana kita "
"perlu mencegah bias pada partisipan sebelum melakukan eksperimen."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "Prosedur"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"The specific sounds, images, and videos used will vary, but may include: "
"recordings of ambient sounds, noise-bursts, speech, music, simple tones, "
"naturalistic images, animated images, comics, faces, objects, geometric "
"shapes, fractal images, or videos of natural environments."
msgstr ""
"Suara, gambar, dan video tertentu yang digunakan akan bervariasi, tetapi "
"dapat mencakup: rekaman suara ambien, semburan suara, ucapan, musik, nada "
"sederhana, gambar naturalistik, gambar animasi, komik, wajah, objek, bentuk "
"geometris, gambar fraktal, atau video lingkungan alam."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Tujuan"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid "For the Max-Planck-Society, this is:"
msgstr "Untuk Max-Planck-Society, ini adalah:"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid ""
"Note that in some studies data deletion will not be possible, in this case "
"we will ask you specifically to consent to this procedure in a separate "
"consent form."
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahwa dalam beberapa studi, penghapusan data tidak dapat "
"dilakukan, dalam hal ini kami akan meminta Anda secara khusus untuk "
"menyetujui prosedur ini dalam formulir persetujuan terpisah."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid ""
"You also have the right to submit an objection to the supervisory authority."
msgstr ""
"Anda juga memiliki hak untuk mengajukan keberatan kepada otoritas pengawas."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid ""
"You have the right to information regarding the data relating to you that is"
" stored at the Max-Planck-Institute, the right to correct inaccurate data, "
"and the right to demand the deletion of data in cases of inadmissible data "
"storage and the right to data portability."
msgstr ""
"Anda memiliki hak atas informasi mengenai data yang berkaitan dengan Anda "
"yang disimpan di Max-Planck-Institute, hak untuk mengoreksi data yang tidak "
"akurat, dan hak untuk meminta penghapusan data jika terjadi penyimpanan data"
" yang tidak dapat diterima dan hak atas portabilitas data."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid "Your rights"
msgstr "Hak-hak Anda"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-risks"
msgid "Risks/Discomforts"
msgstr "Risiko/Ketidaknyamanan"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-risks"
msgid ""
"There are no risks for participating in this study beyond those associated "
"with normal computer use."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada risiko dalam berpartisipasi dalam penelitian ini selain risiko "
"yang terkait dengan penggunaan komputer secara normal."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Data will be stored temporarily on external servers and desktops/laptops "
"that are password protected."
msgstr ""
"Data akan disimpan sementara di server eksternal dan desktop/laptop yang "
"dilindungi kata sandi."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid "No data will be stored permanently on external servers."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada data yang akan disimpan secara permanen di server eksternal."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"The data will be then stored permanently in the institute servers with hard "
"disks encrypted using industry-standard encryption software."
msgstr ""
"Data kemudian akan disimpan secara permanen di server institut dengan hard "
"disk yang dienkripsi menggunakan perangkat lunak enkripsi standar industri."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid ""
"The investigator may withdraw you from this research if circumstances arise "
"which warrant doing so."
msgstr ""
"Peneliti dapat menarik Anda dari penelitian ini jika ada keadaan yang "
"mengharuskannya."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid "Voluntary participation"
msgstr "Partisipasi sukarela"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid ""
"You are free to discontinue participation in this study at any time without "
"penalty."
msgstr ""
"Anda bebas untuk menghentikan partisipasi dalam penelitian ini kapan saja "
"tanpa penalti."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid ""
"You are free to refuse to take part, and you may stop taking part at any "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Anda bebas untuk menolak ikut serta, dan Anda dapat berhenti berpartisipasi "
"kapan saja."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid "Your participation in this research is voluntary."
msgstr "Partisipasi Anda dalam penelitian ini bersifat sukarela."

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent"
msgid ""
"Following open science practices to improve science reusability and "
"replicability, we may want to publish the dataset collected in this "
"experiment as soon as the study is finished."
msgstr ""
"Mengikuti praktik sains terbuka untuk meningkatkan penggunaan ulang dan "
"replikasi sains, kami mungkin ingin mempublikasikan kumpulan data yang "
"dikumpulkan dalam eksperimen ini segera setelah penelitian ini selesai."

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent"
msgid ""
"This includes audio-visual recordings, such as a recording of your finger-"
"tapping in response to a sound or video, or to record yourself speaking or "
"singing."
msgstr ""
"Ini termasuk rekaman audio-visual, seperti rekaman ketukan jari Anda saat "
"merespons suara atau video, atau merekam diri Anda sendiri saat berbicara "
"atau bernyanyi."

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent"
msgid ""
"We may also want to publish certain materials as part of the scientific "
"publication, such as a demo video of the task or part of an interview."
msgstr ""
"Kami mungkin juga ingin mempublikasikan materi tertentu sebagai bagian dari "
"publikasi ilmiah, seperti video demo tugas atau bagian dari wawancara."

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"However, your data will not be directly associated with your name or other "
"identifiers in any way (we will not specify your name when presenting "
"audio/video materials of yours)."
msgstr ""
"Namun, data Anda tidak akan secara langsung dikaitkan dengan nama Anda atau "
"pengidentifikasi lainnya dengan cara apa pun (kami tidak akan menyebutkan "
"nama Anda saat menyajikan materi audio/video Anda)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Since the audio-visual recordings collected in this experiment may be made "
"public, we cannot guarantee anonymity of your data if you participate in "
"this experiment."
msgstr ""
"Karena rekaman audio-visual yang dikumpulkan dalam eksperimen ini dapat "
"dipublikasikan, kami tidak dapat menjamin kerahasiaan data Anda jika Anda "
"berpartisipasi dalam eksperimen ini."

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-disclaimer"
msgid ""
"Although your data will not be associated with personal identifiers, it is "
"possible to link your personal information based on audio-visual recordings"
msgstr ""
"Meskipun data Anda tidak akan dikaitkan dengan pengidentifikasi pribadi, "
"informasi pribadi Anda dapat ditautkan berdasarkan rekaman audio-visual"

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-disclaimer"
msgid ""
