"Materi audio-visual hanya akan dibagikan jika Anda menyetujui formulir "
"persetujuan tambahan seperti yang dijelaskan di atas."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"In these cases, we may share your audio-visual material along with fully "
"anonymized data, such as demographic, aggregated, or extracted data."
msgstr ""
"Dalam kasus ini, kami dapat membagikan materi audio-visual Anda bersama "
"dengan data yang sepenuhnya dianonimkan, seperti data demografis, agregat, "
