#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-overview"
msgid ""
"The purpose of this online form is to give you information to help you "
"decide whether you want to take part in a research study."
msgstr ""
"Tujuan dari formulir online ini adalah untuk memberikan Anda informasi yang "
"dapat membantu Anda memutuskan apakah Anda ingin ikut serta dalam sebuah "
"penelitian."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-overview"
msgid ""
"This research is being conducted by researchers at the Max-Planck-Institute "
"for Empirical Aesthetics."
msgstr ""
"Penelitian ini dilakukan oleh para peneliti di Max-Planck-Institute for "
"Empirical Aesthetics."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"Specifically, we aim to combine a wide range of behavioural methodologies to"
" characterize the ways in which people from diverse backgrounds internalize "
"and process external conditions, both in the auditory (e.g., speech, music) "
"and visual (e.g., faces, color) domains."
msgstr ""
"Secara khusus, kami bertujuan untuk menggabungkan berbagai metodologi "
"perilaku untuk mengkarakterisasi cara-cara orang dari berbagai latar "
"belakang menginternalisasi dan memproses kondisi eksternal, baik dalam "
"domain pendengaran (misalnya, ucapan, musik) dan visual (misalnya, wajah, "
"warna)."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"The purpose of this project is to study the role of experience and exposure "
"in creating and affecting our perception, decisions and actions."
msgstr ""
"Tujuan dari proyek ini adalah untuk mempelajari peran pengalaman dan paparan"
" dalam menciptakan dan memengaruhi persepsi, keputusan, dan tindakan kita."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"We are also interested in the way that these internal representations affect"
" human decision making and behaviour."
msgstr ""
"Kami juga tertarik dengan cara representasi internal ini memengaruhi "
"pengambilan keputusan dan perilaku manusia."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Audio-visual material will not be indexed by personal information but will "
"be linked to personal information by a key (such as “afasd12314asdasd”)."
msgstr ""
"Materi audio-visual tidak akan diindeks berdasarkan informasi pribadi, namun"
" akan ditautkan ke informasi pribadi dengan sebuah kunci (seperti "
"\"afasd12314asdasd\")."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"During data collection, audio-visual material will be recorded on a separate"
" server."
msgstr ""
"Selama pengumpulan data, materi audio-visual akan direkam di server "
"terpisah."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Personal information will be stored separately from audio-visual materials "
"and encrypted using a strong encryption protocol (such as Advanced "
"Encryption Standard)."
msgstr ""
"Informasi pribadi akan disimpan secara terpisah dari materi audio-visual dan"
" dienkripsi menggunakan protokol enkripsi yang kuat (seperti Advanced "
"Encryption Standard)."

